  designNotes: 'The user, 2026-10-16: a poisoned gift. Taqiyya, the doctrine of hiding
    one''s faith to survive, as a gift that hides its purpose: target enemy creature
    gets +2 Attack (the gift, for all to see) and a secret Kill Order 1 (the purpose,
    unseen): at the next Day''s Dusk it''s destroyed. Quicker than Death By "Natural
    Causes", but they hit harder until then. A Cleanse removes the Kill Order, knowingly
    or not.'
  artDescription: A serene robed figure bowing slightly and offering an ornate gift
    box tied with a gold ribbon, both hands extended in welcome; on the wall behind,
    the box's shadow is a coiled snake.
  defaultTargetType: 4
